{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102350","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1310235001:0":{"text":"すっごく楽しいお祭りですね！どのイベントも面白くて、雪だるまチェイスのトラブルも、あれはあれでスリル満点でした！","source_cn":"祭典太有趣了！不管是堆雪人打雪仗还是滑冰都很好玩，就算...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x960B5C6DA7A31F0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310235002:0":{"text":"でしょう？冬の祭典は、公国で一番楽しいお祭りなんだから！","source_cn":"对吧？我一直觉得冬日祭典是整个公国最好玩的节日！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89E2BEBA9AB2606D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310235003:0":{"text":"気に入ってくれて嬉しいわ！","source_cn":"你们也喜欢，真是太好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA32D4B96593A65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310235004:0":{"text":"でも、一番面白くて、刺激的で人気のあるイベントがまだ残ってるわよ。","source_cn":"不过，祭典里最有趣、最刺激、最受欢迎的项目你们还没体验到呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x519E4DD71A01D4F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310235005:0":{"text":"ええ？まだあるんですか？どんなイベントなんです？","source_cn":"什么什么？还有我们没玩到的？公主殿下，你说的是什么项目？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9156338C9957A518","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_ti